#api call for delete doctor
###
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/v2/doctors/7/
Accept: application/json

#api call for create admin
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v2/admin-register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"superuser",
    "email":"superuser@gmail.com",
